      "id": "html-body",
      "type": "html",
      "content": "<main class=\"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-50 to-white\">\n      <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-16 max-w-4xl\">\n        <header class=\"mb-12\">\n          <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-bold text-gray-500 mb-3 font-mono\">Newsroom Contact</p>\n          <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4\">\n            Tip the Newsroom\n          </h1>\n          <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600\">\n            Confidential tips, public records leads, and accountability story pitches reviewed by a named editor within 48 hours.\n          </p>\n        </header>\n\n        <section class=\"prose prose-lg max-w-none\">\n          <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm p-8 mb-8\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">\n              How to Contact Us\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">\n              Objective Wire accepts tips via email. Source identity is protected by editorial policy. We do not share, sell, or disclose tip sources under any circumstances.\n            </p>\n            <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">\n              <strong>Editorial tips and story pitches:</strong><br/>\n              <a href=\"mailto:editorial@objectivewire.com\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline\">editorial@objectivewire.com</a>\n            </p>\n            <p class=\"text-gray-700\">\n              <strong>Corrections and factual disputes:</strong><br/>\n              <a href=\"mailto:editorial@objectivewire.com\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline\">editorial@objectivewire.com</a>\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8\">\n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm p-6\">\n              <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">What We Cover</h3>\n              <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <li>Public records and FOIA leads</li>\n                <li>Accountability and misconduct stories</li>\n                <li>Creator economy and influencer news</li>\n                <li>Cars, supercars, and manufacturer claims</li>\n                <li>Sports, World Cup, Premier League, MLB</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm p-6\">\n              <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4\">Our Standards</h3>\n              <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <li>Named bylines on every published article</li>\n                <li>Primary sources only</li>\n                <li>Public corrections policy</li>\n                <li>Source identity protected</li>\n                <li>No anonymous editorial</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </main>"
    }
